WEBVTT

00:15:58.945 --> 00:16:01.588
with which to beat your politicians.

00:16:01.588 --> 00:16:03.895
When you elect them, when you reelect them,

00:16:03.895 --> 00:16:05.307
when you vote for them, when you listen

00:16:05.307 --> 00:16:07.842
to what they're offering you,

00:16:07.842 --> 00:16:09.554
use that word, "good,"

00:16:09.554 --> 00:16:11.038
and ask yourself,

00:16:11.038 --> 00:16:13.111
"Is that what a good country would do?"

00:16:13.111 --> 00:16:16.404
And if the answer is no, be very suspicious.

00:16:16.404 --> 00:16:18.829
Ask yourself, is that the behavior

00:16:18.829 --> 00:16:20.265
of my country?

00:16:20.265 --> 00:16:22.397
Do I want to come from a country

00:16:22.397 --> 00:16:23.964
where the government, in my name,

00:16:23.964 --> 00:16:25.826
is doing things like that?

00:16:25.826 --> 00:16:27.582
Or do I, on the other hand,

00:16:27.582 --> 00:16:29.210
prefer the idea of walking around the world

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.364
with my head held high thinking, "Yeah,